{"sha": "8f5c5ccb278e5fae451b3508b80b1c79b62e646bf29250dc43b54bb8499add72", "body": ["\\chapter{中点与平行}\\label{ch:g8:midpoints}", "", "连接三角形两边的中点，所得线段", "总与第三边平行，且长度恰为第三边的一半。这", "“中点定理”及其逆定理是一个重要思想的初步体验 ---", "平行线截得的线段成比例 --- 这一思想将", "在\\cref{ch:g9:thales}中发展为泰勒斯定理。", "", "\\section{中点定理}", "", "\\begin{theorem}[中点定理]\\label{thm:g8:midpoints:direct}", "在三角形 $ABC$ 中，设 $I$ 为 $[AB]$ 的中点，$J$ 为", "$[AC]$ 的中点。则直线 $(IJ)$ 平行于 $(BC)$，且", "\\[", "IJ = \\frac{BC}{2} .", "\\]", "\\end{theorem}", "", "\\begin{proof}[证明思路]", "设 $K$ 为 $I$ 关于 $J$ 的对称点（即半转，", "见\\cref{ch:g7:central}）。四边形 $AICK$ 的对角线 $[IK]$", "与 $[AC]$ 相交于公共中点 $J$，故它是", "平行四边形，于是 $KC$ 平行于 $AI$，即平行于 $(AB)$，且", "$KC = AI = IB$。再看 $IBCK$，它有两条对边（$[IB]$ 与", "$[KC]$）平行且相等，故它也是平行四边形（由", "\\cref{thm:g7:central:recognize}可知），因此 $(IK) \\parallel (BC)$ ---", "即 $(IJ) \\parallel (BC)$ --- 且 $BC = IK = 2\\,IJ$。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=1.1]", "  \\coordinate (A) at (1.7,2.9);", "  \\coordinate (B) at (0,0);", "  \\coordinate (C) at (4.6,0);", "  \\coordinate (I) at ($(A)!0.5!(B)$);", "  \\coordinate (J) at ($(A)!0.5!(C)$);", "  \\draw[thick] (A) -- (B) -- (C) -- cycle;", "  \\draw[omThm, very thick] (I) -- (J);", "  \\fill (A) circle (1.5pt) node[above, font=\\small] {$A$};", "  \\fill (B) circle (1.5pt) node[below left, font=\\small] {$B$};", "  \\fill (C) circle (1.5pt) node[below right, font=\\small] {$C$};", "  \\fill[omThm] (I) circle (1.5pt) node[left, font=\\small] {$I$};", "  \\fill[omThm] (J) circle (1.5pt) node[right, font=\\small] {$J$};", "  \\draw ($(A)!0.22!(B)$) ++(-0.09,-0.05) -- ++(0.18,0.1);", "  \\draw ($(A)!0.72!(B)$) ++(-0.09,-0.05) -- ++(0.18,0.1);", "  \\draw ($(A)!0.25!(C)$) ++(-0.06,-0.1) -- ++(0.12,0.2);", "  \\draw ($(A)!0.25!(C)$) ++(0.02,-0.1) -- ++(0.12,0.2);", "  \\draw ($(A)!0.75!(C)$) ++(-0.06,-0.1) -- ++(0.12,0.2);", "  \\draw ($(A)!0.75!(C)$) ++(0.02,-0.1) -- ++(0.12,0.2);", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 中点线段 $[IJ]$（红色）平行于第三", "边 $(BC)$，且长度为其一半。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{example}\\label{ex:g8:midpoints:direct}", "在三角形 $ABC$ 中，$BC = 9$ 厘米，$I$ 为 $[AB]$ 的中点，", "$J$ 为 $[AC]$ 的中点，将两者相连。不作任何测量：", "则 $(IJ) \\parallel (BC)$，且 $IJ = \\frac92 = 4.5$ 厘米。小三角形", "$AIJ$ 是 $ABC$ 按一半比例缩小的相似形 --- 其周长也是", "$ABC$ 周长的一半。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{theorem}[逆定理]\\label{thm:g8:midpoints:converse}", "在三角形 $ABC$ 中，$I$ 为 $[AB]$ 的中点，过该点", "且与 $(BC)$ \\emph{平行}的直线与边 $[AC]$ 相交于其中点。", "\\end{theorem}", "\\admitted", "", "\\begin{example}\\label{ex:g8:midpoints:converse}", "一条小路穿过一块三角形田地，从某一条边的中点出发，", "并与其对边平行。逆定理保证", "小路恰好在另一条边的中点处离开田地 --- 另一侧", "无需测量。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{method}[在定理与逆定理之间选择]\\label{met:g8:midpoints:choose}", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item \\emph{已知两个中点} $\\Rightarrow$ 用直接定理，", "        得出平行及长度为一半的结论。", "  \\item \\emph{已知一个中点与一组平行关系} $\\Rightarrow$ 用", "        逆定理，得出交点是中点。", "  \\item 写明所用的三角形、中点及定理，", "        每项各用一句话 --- 说明。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{method}", "", "\\section{一半大小的三角形}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[中点三角形]\\label{prop:g8:midpoints:medial}", "连接三角形三边的中点，将其分成", "四个面积相等的三角形，每一个都是原三角形一半大小的相似形。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "中点三角形的每条边都平行于 $ABC$ 的某一边，且", "长度为其一半（连续三次应用\\cref{thm:g8:midpoints:direct}）。", "四个小三角形的三边长度相同，故", "它们全等；它们共同铺满 $ABC$，因此每个", "的面积为原三角形面积的四分之一。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=1.05]", "  \\coordinate (A) at (1.9,3.0);", "  \\coordinate (B) at (0,0);", "  \\coordinate (C) at (5.0,0);", "  \\coordinate (I) at ($(A)!0.5!(B)$);", "  \\coordinate (J) at ($(A)!0.5!(C)$);", "  \\coordinate (K) at ($(B)!0.5!(C)$);", "  \\draw[thick] (A) -- (B) -- (C) -- cycle;", "  \\fill[omThm!12] (I) -- (J) -- (K) -- cycle;", "  \\draw[omThm, thick] (I) -- (J) -- (K) -- cycle;", "  \\fill (A) circle (1.4pt) node[above, font=\\small] {$A$};", "  \\fill (B) circle (1.4pt) node[below left, font=\\small] {$B$};", "  \\fill (C) circle (1.4pt) node[below right, font=\\small] {$C$};", "  \\fill[omThm] (I) circle (1.4pt) node[left, font=\\small] {$I$};", "  \\fill[omThm] (J) circle (1.4pt) node[right, font=\\small] {$J$};", "  \\fill[omThm] (K) circle (1.4pt) node[below, font=\\small] {$K$};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", ""]}